flowchart LR
    subgraph Physical_Model[Physical and mathematical model]
      A[Physical scenario] --> B[PDE specification]
      B --> C[Initial and boundary conditions]
    end
    subgraph AI_Lab[AI-supported research workbench]
      C --> D[Literature and theorem retrieval]
      D --> E[Candidate conjectures and proof ideas]
      E --> F[Symbolic algebra and numerical tests]
      F --> G[Assumption and counterexample checks]
    end
    subgraph Verification[Evidence and review]
      G --> H{Rigorous argument?}
      H -->|No| E
      H -->|Yes| I[Human proof review]
      I --> J[Optional proof assistant]
      J --> K[Independent review and reproduction]
      K --> L[Qualified theorem or research finding]
    end
